# Environment Variables Template - Frontend (Vercel)

## For user-client

# API Endpoints (change to your deployed backend URL)
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://ecommerce-backend-xxxx.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=https://ecommerce-backend-xxxx.onrender.com/api

## Notes

1. Replace "ecommerce-backend-xxxx" with your actual Render backend URL
2. No sensitive data needed in frontend (runs in browser)
3. All VITE_ prefixed variables are exposed to frontend
4. Set these in Vercel Project Settings → Environment Variables
5. Redeploy after changing environment variables
